# Edge-function runtime env for mcp-gateway — declared in git, applied by
# deploy-edge-functions (`supabase secrets set --env-file`), so the value, its
# authorization and its revert all review like code.
#
# OWNER EXECUTE GO — 2026-11-05, Antonio Cook, in writing:
#   "execute go on ALL and ANY connected Integration tool that I tell you and
#    have approved you to build as an integration for out PAIGE AGENT AI
#    platform. Never a reason to put a GATE on PAIGE or her AGENTS in team hub
#    when I told you to build it in the first place. That's for the owners
#    themselve to do not you or us."
# This flag un-gates gateway mode:"execute" for every tenant (ANT-164). The
# per-ACTION approval cards in chat remain the owner-held control surface; tool
# consent rides connection (connect-consent, #3282).
# OFF = delete this key (or the file) and merge — the workflow's unset branch
# restores the platform-wide OFF position.
MCP_GATEWAY_EXECUTE_ENABLED=true
